  "about": {
    "title": "About the EX Legend Maker set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX Legend Maker is a EX expansion released on 13 February 2006. It has 93 cards: 92 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 82 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 92 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (174 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 175 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
